WEBVTT

1
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:23,180
What does Han Mo mean?

2
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:24,480
promise to marry me

3
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:27,040
But he never gave up looking for Shen Nian, could it be that

4
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,830
You got suspicious of me and promised to marry me

5
00:00:29,950 --> 00:00:30,950
He's holding me back

6
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:32,910
What if she really finds out something?

7
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:35,030
The Shen family will definitely not let me go.

8
00:00:35,390 --> 00:00:36,310
I have to stop her

9
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:43,700
Where are you going, Brother Mo?

10
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:45,300
You have already connected with Sister Wei

11
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:46,420
It's been two days of hard work

12
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:47,980
I'm worried about your body

13
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:50,700
I want to see you Shen Zhenzhu

14
00:00:51,670 --> 00:00:53,110
Ever since Shen Nian’s accident

15
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:54,830
You've been trying little ways

16
00:00:54,830 --> 00:00:59,220
Stop everyone from going to her why didn't I?

17
00:00:59,220 --> 00:01:03,580
What are you afraid of?

18
00:01:03,940 --> 00:01:05,580
Are you afraid that she will come back alive?

19
00:01:09,180 --> 00:01:10,620
I just accepted the reality

20
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:12,260
Sister is dead

21
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:16,850
She had been killed and eaten a long time ago, right?

22
00:01:18,060 --> 00:01:19,860
Then you'd better pray a little bit

23
00:01:20,530 --> 00:01:21,770
she is really dead

24
00:01:21,770 --> 00:01:32,240
Brother Mo may come back alive

25
00:01:33,520 --> 00:01:35,480
Don't ever think about seeing that bitch again in this life

26
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:48,440
Even if you watch you die, you won’t let me live.

27
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:53,850
I can only let you die
